{"speciesId":561,"names":{"fr":"Cryptéro","es":"Sigilyph","en":"Sigilyph","ja":"シンボラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit qu’il parcourt toujours le même itinéraire parce qu’il a gardé la mémoire de la ville antique qu’il protégeait."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They never vary the route they fly, because their memories of guarding an ancient city remain steadfast."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il était le dieu protecteur d’une ville antique. Il repoussait les envahisseurs à coups de pouvoir psychique."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The guardians of an ancient city, they use their psychic power to attack enemies that invade their territory."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping watch for invaders."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping watch for invaders."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il était le dieu protecteur d’une ville antique. Il repoussait les envahisseurs à coups de pouvoir psychique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Fue la deidad protectora de una ciudad milenaria. Ataca con su poder psíquico a los enemigos que invaden su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The guardians of an ancient city, they use their psychic power to attack enemies that invade their territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"古代都市の 守り神だった。 縄張りに 侵入した 敵を サイコパワーで 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Dieu protecteur d’une ville antique, il suivait toujours le même itinéraire afin de prévenir tout risque d’invasion."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Deidad protectora de una antigua ciudad. Siempre merodea por la misma ruta y permanece alerta en busca de intrusos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping wa